      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6a811ed8523ad161332f6af0|full_name} This topic reads more like a user support request than a bug report. See https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/360062658413-I-found-a-bug-I-want-to-report-a-bug on how to report bugs effectively.\n\nFor something like this to be effectively reported as a bug, it would need:\n\n1. [Output logs](https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/9521522810899-Where-do-I-find-my-Output-Logs-and-Crash-Dumps) to isolate the plausibility of other errors.\n\n2. AS number and IP-range that's blocked, in the case of Photon servers connectivity issues.\n\n3. Tested to be working from another network connection (VPN) / hardware, not related to your own setup.\n\n4. Reproducible by multiple people in the same ASN/IP-block with a root cause.\n\n5. Be tested against multiple VRChat regions (US, USE, EU, JP).\n\n6. Date/time when the issue was first experienced recently, if known. (Approximately since 3-4 August 2026 for AT&T.)\n\nFor isolated issues or customer support visit https://help.vrchat.com/",
